                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An absolutely fantastic recreatation of playing as a QB with completely unforgiving and very realistic throwing mechanics and playmaking. \n This has some seriously SMART AI (this actually shocked me), a playmaking board in a lockeroom as a homebase to make some plays which is very intuitive.  Pplay some 2 min drills with the plays you created in rounds of increasing difficulty.  Im about 4 hours in and ive made it to the 5th round with about 200 points.  I just cant stop playing.  This is a game BEGGING to be expanded upon.  I told the dev i wasnt a fan of the ringtoss and more just playing routes as it reminds me of my days playing QB as a kid..  He responded instantly, and he then added a skip button the very next day.   Great game, great dev.  I cant say enough good things.  If you like football, give it a shot you wont regret it.",
